{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest v2 COLLECTION — the FOURTEEN-TIMES SCREEN (collection WINNING-SPEC §4.4,
  "elmsnest-v2-coll-span"). One screen that dissolves a 69.90 - 999.90 span into an honest sentence:
  the expensive lamp is not a better lamp, it is a set of eight.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- what is derived, and from where
  NOTHING in this section is typed (§6.19). Every figure comes from the collection itself:
    the span and the ratio        product.price_min / product.price_max across collection.products
    the axis of every rung        snippets/elmsnest-v2-coll-axis.liquid (plumbing CONTRACT §2)
    every per-unit figure         the parser's stop field 13 — variant price divided by the number of
                                  units in that value, rounded to the agora. This section NEVER does
                                  price arithmetic itself: prices are strings already rounded
                                  (CONTRACT risk 14) and only price_cents is ever added or compared.
    the three band counts         counted in Liquid over the same rows
    the copy's numbers            the settings hold {ratio} {ratio_word} {units} {units_word} {price}
                                  and {value} placeholders; Liquid substitutes them, so the shipped
                                  default deck renders EXACTLY §4.4's verbatim sentence on the path
                                  collection and stays true on any other collection.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- when it renders, and when it does not
  §4.4 ships this screen on path, spot and /all and keeps it off decor and wall. One template serves
  all five URLs (§5.1), so the choice cannot be a per-URL setting — it is made from the data:

    enabled            off  -> nothing at all is printed, not even the section wrapper
    fewer than 2 products   -> nothing
    no span (min = max)     -> nothing
    show_on = auto     and no product in the collection is measured in QUANTITY -> nothing

  That last test is the honest one: this screen exists to say "the expensive one is a set of N", a
  sentence only a quantity axis can support. It resolves to path (5 quantity products), spot (1) and
  /all — and to nothing on decor (metres and one area) and wall (colours). Set show_on to «always» to
  print it on a collection with no quantity axis; the deck then falls back to deck_alt, which names
  the expensive variant instead of counting units.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- the ladder (C6, switchboard)
  One rung per product, ordered by price_min ascending. Liquid cannot sort a product list by a
  computed key, so PASS 1 prints one delimited record per product and the records are sorted as
  strings on a zero-padded price key — the same printed-model convention the plumbing uses because
  a snippet's assigns never reach its caller (CONTRACT §2.1, risk 1).

  Each rung: the title and its axis caption, a bar SOLID from 0 to price_min and a HAIRLINE onward to
  price_max on one shared LINEAR scale to the collection's maximum (§4.4 n-n 3 — a log scale would
  flatter the expensive set), the entry price, and for a quantity axis the per-unit figure at the
  smallest and the largest stop. Rungs are grouped under three price band headers that are HEADERS,
  not controls (§6.1 — this page has no toolbar); their counts come from Liquid.

  The closing columns are one hairline table per unit stop (unit_stops, default «4,8»), each row a
  product that really sells at that quantity — an EXACT match on the option value, never the nearest
  one (§4.4 n-n 2). A quantity product that matches no column prints its own stops instead
  («נמכרת ב־2 או ב־6 בלבד»), which is how swaying-solar-path-lights-ip65 stays honest.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- no-JS / reduced motion
  There is no behaviour here. No control, no toggle, no script-built number: every rung, bar, price
  and per-unit figure is markup, and the bars read at their full length with scripting disabled
  because the core's --lit is 1 until html.env2-js dims it. The only thing JavaScript adds is the
  cheapest-first fill (70 ms stagger, capped 900 ms). Under prefers-reduced-motion the transitions
  are off and every bar is drawn at once. Nothing is lost, nothing is unreadable, nothing is unbuyable
  — the rung titles are plain links to the product pages.

  No image, no glyph plate and no card is rendered here, so this section needs no sprite (CONTRACT
  risk 11) and cannot spend one of §3.1's two scrim surfaces (risk 10). It carries no .env2-btn, so
  core REPORT §9.1's ink-on-glow anchor cannot appear (risk 9).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign FS = '~~F~~'
  assign RS = '~~R~~'
  assign IS = '^'
  assign ES = ';'
  assign env2_s = section.settings
  assign env2_c = collection
  assign env2_on = true
  if env2_s.enabled == false
    assign env2_on = false
  endif
  assign env2_perword = env2_s.per_unit_word | default: '₪ לנקודה'
  assign env2_unitnoun = env2_s.unit_noun | default: 'נקודות'
  assign env2_stoplist = env2_s.unit_stops | default: '4,8' | replace: ' ', '' | split: ','
  assign env2_mw = 'אחד,שניים,שלושה,ארבעה,חמישה,שישה,שבעה,שמונה,תשעה,עשרה,אחד־עשר,שנים־עשר,שלושה־עשר,ארבעה־עשר,חמישה־עשר,שישה־עשר,שבעה־עשר,שמונה־עשר,תשעה־עשר,עשרים' | split: ','
  assign env2_fw = 'אחת,שתיים,שלוש,ארבע,חמש,שש,שבע,שמונה,תשע,עשר,אחת־עשרה,שתים־עשרה' | split: ','
-%}

{%- paginate env2_c.products by 50 -%}

{%- comment -%}
  PASS 1 — one printed record per product. This is the only place the axis parser is asked, and the
  only place any number is computed. Fields, all of them plain strings:
    0 sort key (price_min in agorot + 100000000, so a string sort is a numeric sort)
    1 handle · 2 url · 3 title
    4 unit · 5 measured · 6 price_min cents · 7 price_max cents · 8 price_varies
    9 axis name · 10 min number · 11 max number · 12 unit label · 13 how many option values
    14 first value · 15 second value
    16 per-unit at the cheapest-per-unit stop · 17 at the dearest · 18 the per-unit noun
    19 the stops that match unit_stops, «number^price^per_unit» joined by «;»
    20 every stop number of a quantity axis, joined by «;»
    21 the terminator, so no real field is ever last
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_rows = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_min_c = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_max_c = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_qty_n = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_top_units = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_top_per = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_top_value = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_n = 0 -%}
{%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
  {%- capture env2_ax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_p -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign env2_recs = env2_ax | split: RS -%}
  {%- if env2_recs.size > 1 -%}
    {%- assign env2_m = env2_recs[0] | split: FS -%}
    {%- assign env2_u = env2_m[3] -%}
    {%- assign env2_meas = env2_m[9] -%}
    {%- assign env2_pmin = env2_p.price_min | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_pmax = env2_p.price_max | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_n = env2_n | plus: 1 -%}
    {%- if env2_min_c == 0 or env2_pmin < env2_min_c -%}{%- assign env2_min_c = env2_pmin -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if env2_meas == '1' and env2_u == 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_qty_n = env2_qty_n | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      The stops of this product: the per-unit extremes, the exact matches for the closing columns,
      and the dearest option value — which is what the resolution line is about.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign env2_perlo = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_perhi = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_perlo_c = 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_perhi_c = 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_hits = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_qnums = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_v1 = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_v2 = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_top_c = 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_top_n = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_top_p = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_top_v = '' -%}
    {%- for env2_rec in env2_recs offset: 1 -%}
      {%- assign s = env2_rec | split: FS -%}
      {%- if forloop.index == 1 -%}{%- assign env2_v1 = s[2] -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if forloop.index == 2 -%}{%- assign env2_v2 = s[2] -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign env2_sc = s[11] | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- if env2_sc > env2_top_c -%}
        {%- assign env2_top_c = env2_sc -%}
        {%- assign env2_top_n = s[3] -%}
        {%- assign env2_top_p = s[13] -%}
        {%- assign env2_top_v = s[2] -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if s[13] != '' -%}
        {%- assign env2_pc = s[13] | replace: ',', '' | times: 100 | round -%}
        {%- if env2_perlo_c == 0 or env2_pc < env2_perlo_c -%}
          {%- assign env2_perlo_c = env2_pc -%}{%- assign env2_perlo = s[13] -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_pc > env2_perhi_c -%}
          {%- assign env2_perhi_c = env2_pc -%}{%- assign env2_perhi = s[13] -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if s[3] != '' and s[4] == 'qty' -%}
        {%- assign env2_qnums = env2_qnums | append: s[3] | append: ES -%}
        {%- assign env2_sn = s[3] | plus: 0.0 -%}
        {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
          {%- assign env2_want = env2_st | plus: 0.0 -%}
          {%- if env2_want > 0 and env2_sn == env2_want and s[13] != '' -%}
            {%- assign env2_hits = env2_hits | append: s[3] | append: IS | append: s[10] | append: IS | append: s[13] | append: ES -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}

    {%- if env2_pmax > env2_max_c -%}
      {%- assign env2_max_c = env2_pmax -%}
      {%- assign env2_top_value = env2_top_v -%}
      {%- assign env2_top_per = '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_top_units = '' -%}
      {%- if env2_u == 'qty' and env2_meas == '1' -%}
        {%- assign env2_top_units = env2_top_n -%}
        {%- assign env2_top_per = env2_top_p -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- assign env2_key = 100000000 | plus: env2_pmin -%}
    {%- assign env2_varies = '0' -%}
    {%- if env2_pmax > env2_pmin -%}{%- assign env2_varies = '1' -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- assign env2_plabel = env2_m[6] -%}
    {%- if env2_u == 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_plabel = env2_perword -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- capture env2_row -%}{{ env2_key }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[1] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_p.url }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_p.title }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_u }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_meas }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_pmin }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_pmax }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_varies }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[2] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[11] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[12] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[4] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[18] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_v1 }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_v2 }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_perlo }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_perhi }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_plabel }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_hits }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_qnums }}{{ FS }}e{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- if env2_rows == '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_rows = env2_row -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign env2_rows = env2_rows | append: RS | append: env2_row -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The four gates of §4.4. A collection with no span, or with no quantity axis to explain one, is not
  a fourteen-times screen and this section prints absolutely nothing on it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_render = env2_on -%}
{%- if env2_n < 2 or env2_max_c <= env2_min_c or env2_min_c == 0 -%}{%- assign env2_render = false -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_s.show_on != 'always' and env2_qty_n == 0 -%}{%- assign env2_render = false -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- if env2_render -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign env2_ratio = env2_max_c | divided_by: env2_min_c
    assign env2_ri = env2_ratio | minus: 1
    assign env2_ratio_word = env2_ratio
    if env2_ratio > 0 and env2_ratio < 21
      assign env2_ratio_word = env2_mw[env2_ri]
    endif
    assign env2_units_word = env2_top_units
    if env2_top_units != ''
      assign env2_ui = env2_top_units | plus: 0 | minus: 1
      if env2_ui >= 0 and env2_ui < 12
        assign env2_units_word = env2_fw[env2_ui]
      endif
    endif
    assign env2_b1 = env2_s.band_1_max | default: 150 | times: 100
    assign env2_b2 = env2_s.band_2_max | default: 350 | times: 100
    if env2_b2 <= env2_b1
      assign env2_b2 = env2_b1
    endif
    assign env2_list = env2_rows | split: RS | sort
    assign env2_c1 = 0
    assign env2_c2 = 0
    assign env2_c3 = 0
    assign env2_span_c = env2_max_c
    if env2_span_c < 1
      assign env2_span_c = 1
    endif
  -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_list -%}
    {%- assign r = env2_r | split: FS -%}
    {%- assign env2_pc = r[6] | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- if env2_pc <= env2_b1 -%}{%- assign env2_c1 = env2_c1 | plus: 1 -%}
    {%- elsif env2_pc <= env2_b2 -%}{%- assign env2_c2 = env2_c2 | plus: 1 -%}
    {%- else -%}{%- assign env2_c3 = env2_c3 | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- capture env2_ratio_tag -%}<bdi>{{ env2_ratio }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture env2_units_tag -%}<bdi>{{ env2_top_units }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture env2_per_tag -%}<bdi>{{ env2_top_per }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture env2_value_tag -%}<bdi>{{ env2_top_value | escape }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}

  {%- assign env2_eyebrow = env2_s.eyebrow | default: 'אותה קולקציה, פי {ratio_word}' | replace: '{ratio_word}', env2_ratio_word | replace: '{ratio}', env2_ratio -%}
  {%- if env2_top_units != '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_deck = env2_s.deck -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign env2_deck = env2_s.deck_alt -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_deck = env2_deck | replace: '{ratio_word}', env2_ratio_word | replace: '{ratio}', env2_ratio_tag | replace: '{units_word}', env2_units_word | replace: '{units}', env2_units_tag | replace: '{value}', env2_value_tag | replace: '{price}', env2_per_tag -%}
  {%- assign env2_res = '' -%}
  {%- if env2_top_units != '' and env2_top_per != '' and env2_s.resolution_line != blank -%}
    {%- assign env2_res = env2_s.resolution_line | replace: '{units_word}', env2_units_word | replace: '{units}', env2_units_tag | replace: '{price}', env2_per_tag | replace: '{ratio}', env2_ratio_tag -%}
  {%- endif -%}

<section id="env2-coll-span" data-env2-coll-span class="env2-section env2-coll env2-coll-span" dir="rtl" style="scroll-margin-top:90px;--env2-stars:.42" aria-label="{{ env2_s.heading | default: 'כמה מנורות צריך?' | escape }}">
  <div class="env2-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-span__wrap">
    <header class="env2-coll-span__head">
      <div class="env2-coll-span__intro">
        {%- if env2_eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="env2-eyebrow env2-coll-span__eyebrow">{{ env2_eyebrow }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_s.heading != blank -%}<h2 class="env2-h env2-coll-span__h2">{{ env2_s.heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_deck != blank -%}<p class="env2-lead env2-coll-span__deck">{{ env2_deck }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- if env2_res != blank -%}
        <p class="env2-coll-span__res">{{ env2_res }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </header>

    <div class="env2-coll-span__scale">
      <span class="env2-coll-span__scalelabel">{{ env2_s.scale_label | default: 'סולם ליניארי' }}</span>
      <span class="env2-coll-span__scalefig"><bdi>{{ env2_min_c | money_without_currency }}–{{ env2_max_c | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪</span>
    </div>

    <div class="env2-coll-span__ladder">
      {%- assign env2_i = 0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_bandi = 0 -%}
      {%- for env2_band in (1..3) -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign env2_bn = 0
          if env2_band == 1
            assign env2_bn = env2_c1
            capture env2_blabel
              echo 'עד <bdi>'
              echo env2_s.band_1_max | default: 150
              echo '</bdi> ₪'
            endcapture
          elsif env2_band == 2
            assign env2_bn = env2_c2
            capture env2_blabel
              echo '<bdi>'
              echo env2_s.band_1_max | default: 150
              echo '–'
              echo env2_s.band_2_max | default: 350
              echo '</bdi> ₪'
            endcapture
          else
            assign env2_bn = env2_c3
            capture env2_blabel
              echo 'מעל <bdi>'
              echo env2_s.band_2_max | default: 350
              echo '</bdi> ₪'
            endcapture
          endif
        -%}
        {%- if env2_bn > 0 -%}
          {%- assign env2_blk = section.blocks[env2_bandi] -%}
          {%- assign env2_bandi = env2_bandi | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            An absent block, and an empty setting on a present one, both have to leave the computed
            label standing. A missing block prints as the empty string in every engine, so the
            override is decided on the PRINTED value and never on a nil comparison.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- capture env2_ovr -%}{{ env2_blk.settings.label }}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- capture env2_note -%}{{ env2_blk.settings.note }}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- capture env2_battr -%}{{ env2_blk.shopify_attributes }}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_ovr = env2_ovr | strip -%}
          {%- assign env2_note = env2_note | strip -%}
          {%- if env2_ovr != '' -%}{%- assign env2_blabel = env2_ovr -%}{%- endif -%}
          <section class="env2-coll-span__band" data-band="{{ env2_band }}" {{ env2_battr | strip }}>
            <div class="env2-coll-span__bandhead">
              <h3 class="env2-coll-span__bandlabel">{{ env2_blabel }}</h3>
              <p class="env2-coll-span__bandn"><bdi>{{ env2_bn }}</bdi> {{ env2_s.count_noun | default: 'מנורות' }}</p>
            </div>
            {%- if env2_note != '' -%}
              <p class="env2-coll-span__bandnote">{{ env2_note }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            <ol class="env2-coll-span__rungs">
              {%- for env2_r in env2_list -%}
                {%- assign r = env2_r | split: FS -%}
                {%- assign env2_pc = r[6] | plus: 0 -%}
                {%- assign env2_in = false -%}
                {%- if env2_band == 1 and env2_pc <= env2_b1 -%}{%- assign env2_in = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_band == 2 and env2_pc > env2_b1 and env2_pc <= env2_b2 -%}{%- assign env2_in = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_band == 3 and env2_pc > env2_b2 -%}{%- assign env2_in = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_in -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign env2_xc = r[7] | plus: 0
                    assign env2_a10 = env2_pc | times: 1000 | divided_by: env2_span_c
                    assign env2_b10 = env2_xc | times: 1000 | divided_by: env2_span_c
                    assign env2_w10 = env2_b10 | minus: env2_a10
                    assign env2_ai = env2_a10 | divided_by: 10
                    assign env2_af = env2_a10 | modulo: 10
                    assign env2_bi = env2_b10 | divided_by: 10
                    assign env2_bf = env2_b10 | modulo: 10
                    assign env2_wi = env2_w10 | divided_by: 10
                    assign env2_wf = env2_w10 | modulo: 10
                    assign env2_del = env2_i | times: 70
                    if env2_del > 900
                      assign env2_del = 900
                    endif
                    assign env2_i = env2_i | plus: 1
                  -%}
                  <li class="env2-coll-span__rung" data-lamp data-handle="{{ r[1] }}"
                      style="--env2-span-a:{{ env2_ai }}.{{ env2_af }}%;--env2-span-b:{{ env2_bi }}.{{ env2_bf }}%;--env2-span-w:{{ env2_wi }}.{{ env2_wf }}%;--env2-span-d:{{ env2_del }}ms">
                    <div class="env2-coll-span__name">
                      <a href="{{ r[2] }}">{{ r[3] }}</a>
                    </div>
                    {%- comment -%}
                      The axis caption. Shopify gives a product with no real options the placeholder
                      axis «Title» whose one value is «Default Title» — neither is a fact about the
                      lamp and neither is Hebrew, so both are dropped and the caption is not printed
                      at all when nothing true is left to say.
                    {%- endcomment -%}
                    {%- assign env2_axn = r[9] -%}
                    {%- if env2_axn == 'Title' -%}{%- assign env2_axn = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
                    {%- capture env2_axcap -%}
                      {%- if r[5] == '1' and r[10] != '' -%}
                        {%- if r[10] == r[11] -%}
                          <bdi>{{ r[10] }}</bdi>&nbsp;{{ r[12] | escape }}
                        {%- else -%}
                          <bdi>{{ r[10] }}–{{ r[11] }}</bdi>&nbsp;{{ r[12] | escape }}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      {%- elsif r[13] != '' and r[13] != '0' and r[14] != 'Default Title' -%}
                        {%- assign env2_nv = r[13] | plus: 0 -%}
                        {%- if env2_nv > 2 -%}
                          <bdi>{{ env2_nv }}</bdi>&nbsp;{{ env2_s.options_noun | default: 'אפשרויות' }}
                        {%- else -%}
                          <bdi>{{ r[14] | escape }}</bdi>
                          {%- if r[15] != '' -%}<span class="env2-coll-span__sep"> · </span><bdi>{{ r[15] | escape }}</bdi>{%- endif -%}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    {%- endcapture -%}
                    {%- assign env2_axcap = env2_axcap | strip -%}
                    {%- if env2_axn != '' or env2_axcap != '' -%}
                      <p class="env2-coll-span__axis">
                        {{- env2_axn | escape -}}
                        {%- if env2_axn != '' and env2_axcap != '' -%}<span class="env2-coll-span__sep"> · </span>{%- endif -%}
                        {{- env2_axcap -}}
                      </p>
                    {%- endif -%}
                    <div class="env2-coll-span__bar" aria-hidden="true">
                      <span class="env2-coll-span__track"></span>
                      <span class="env2-coll-span__solid"></span>
                      {%- if r[8] == '1' -%}
                        <span class="env2-coll-span__thin"></span>
                        <span class="env2-coll-span__cap"></span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                    <div class="env2-coll-span__figs">
                      <p class="env2-coll-span__from">
{%- if r[8] == '1' -%}<span class="env2-coll-span__fromword">{{ env2_s.from_word | default: 'מ־' }}</span>{%- endif -%}<span class="env2-price"><bdi>{{ env2_pc | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪</span>
                      </p>
                      {%- if r[8] == '1' -%}
                        <p class="env2-coll-span__to">{{ env2_s.to_word | default: 'עד' }} <bdi>{{ env2_xc | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪</p>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if env2_s.show_unit_price != false and r[4] == 'qty' and r[16] != '' -%}
                        <p class="env2-coll-span__per">
                          {%- if r[16] == r[17] -%}
                            <bdi>≈{{ r[16] }}</bdi> {{ r[18] | escape }}
                          {%- else -%}
                            <bdi>≈{{ r[16] }}–{{ r[17] }}</bdi> {{ r[18] | escape }}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </p>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ol>
          </section>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      The closing columns. A product is listed at a quantity only when it really sells that exact
      option value (§4.4 n-n 2); the rows are ordered by the price AT that quantity, so the per-unit
      column reads down. A quantity product that matches no column at all gets its own honest note.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign env2_tblc = 0 -%}
    {%- capture env2_tables -%}
      {%- for env2_st in env2_stoplist -%}
        {%- assign env2_want = env2_st | plus: 0.0 -%}
        {%- if env2_want > 0 -%}
          {%- assign env2_col = '' -%}
          {%- for env2_r in env2_list -%}
            {%- assign r = env2_r | split: FS -%}
            {%- assign env2_hits = r[19] | split: ES -%}
            {%- for env2_h in env2_hits -%}
              {%- assign h = env2_h | split: IS -%}
              {%- assign env2_hn = h[0] | plus: 0.0 -%}
              {%- if env2_hn == env2_want -%}
                {%- assign env2_hc = h[1] | replace: ',', '' | replace: '.', '' | plus: 0 -%}
                {%- assign env2_hk = 100000000 | plus: env2_hc -%}
                {%- capture env2_one -%}{{ env2_hk }}{{ IS }}{{ r[3] }}{{ IS }}{{ r[2] }}{{ IS }}{{ h[1] }}{{ IS }}{{ h[2] }}{{ IS }}{{ r[18] }}{%- endcapture -%}
                {%- if env2_col == '' -%}
                  {%- assign env2_col = env2_one -%}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- assign env2_col = env2_col | append: RS | append: env2_one -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- if env2_col != '' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cols = env2_col | split: RS | sort -%}
            {%- assign env2_tblc = env2_tblc | plus: 1 -%}
            <table class="env2-coll-span__tbl">
              <caption class="env2-coll-span__cap2">{{ env2_s.at_word | default: 'ב־' }}<bdi>{{ env2_st }}</bdi> {{ env2_unitnoun }}</caption>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col">{{ env2_s.col_lamp | default: 'המנורה' }}</th>
                  <th scope="col">{{ env2_s.col_price | default: 'מחיר' }}</th>
                  <th scope="col">{{ env2_perword }}</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {%- for env2_cr in env2_cols -%}
                  {%- assign cr = env2_cr | split: IS -%}
                  <tr>
                    <th scope="row"><a href="{{ cr[2] }}">{{ cr[1] }}</a></th>
                    <td><span class="env2-price"><bdi>{{ cr[3] }}</bdi> ₪</span></td>
                    <td class="env2-coll-span__cell-per"><bdi>≈{{ cr[4] }}</bdi></td>
                  </tr>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        The products that sell by quantity but at none of the quantities above — printed, never
        dropped (§6.6 carries the same principle for the ruler's rows).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign env2_notes = '' -%}
      {%- for env2_r in env2_list -%}
        {%- assign r = env2_r | split: FS -%}
        {%- if env2_tblc > 0 and r[4] == 'qty' and r[5] == '1' and r[19] == '' and r[20] != '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_qn = r[20] | split: ES -%}
          {%- assign env2_line = '' -%}
          {%- for env2_q in env2_qn -%}
            {%- if env2_q != '' -%}
              {%- capture env2_qp -%}{{ env2_s.at_word | default: 'ב־' }}<bdi>{{ env2_q }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
              {%- if env2_line == '' -%}
                {%- assign env2_line = env2_qp -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- assign env2_or = env2_s.or_word | default: 'או' -%}
                {%- assign env2_line = env2_line | append: ' ' | append: env2_or | append: ' ' | append: env2_qp -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- capture env2_one -%}<li class="env2-coll-span__note"><a href="{{ r[2] }}">{{ r[3] }}</a> — {{ env2_s.sold_only | default: 'נמכרת' }} {{ env2_line | strip }} {{ env2_s.only_word | default: 'בלבד' }}</li>{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_notes = env2_notes | append: env2_one -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if env2_notes != '' -%}
        <ul class="env2-coll-span__notes">{{ env2_notes }}</ul>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign env2_tt = env2_tables | strip -%}
    {%- if env2_tt != '' -%}
      <div class="env2-coll-span__close">{{ env2_tables }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if env2_s.foot_note != blank -%}
      <p class="env2-coll-span__foot">{{ env2_s.foot_note }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endpaginate -%}

{% stylesheet %}
.env2-coll-span{padding-block:clamp(72px,8vw,120px) clamp(56px,6vw,96px)}
.env2-coll-span__wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}
.env2-coll-span__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,34ch) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(22px,3vw,54px);align-items:end}
.env2-coll-span__intro{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.env2-coll-span__h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,60px);line-height:1}
.env2-coll-span__deck{max-width:34ch}
.env2-coll-span__deck bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.env2-coll-span__res{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,34px);line-height:1.16;color:var(--env2-glow);text-wrap:balance;padding-inline-start:clamp(0px,2vw,28px);border-inline-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-span__res bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__scale{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-block:clamp(34px,4vw,64px) 0;padding-block-end:10px;border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-span__scalelabel{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--env2-gold)}
.env2-coll-span__scalefig{font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-coll-span__band{display:block;margin-block-start:clamp(26px,3vw,44px)}
.env2-coll-span__bandhead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding-block-end:8px}
.env2-coll-span__bandlabel{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--env2-ink);text-transform:none}
.env2-coll-span__bandlabel bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__bandn{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-coll-span__bandn bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__bandnote{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-width:52ch}
.env2-coll-span__rungs{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.env2-coll-span__rung{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(150px,.62fr);grid-template-areas:"name bar figs" "axis bar figs";column-gap:clamp(16px,2.2vw,34px);row-gap:2px;align-items:center;padding-block:6px 12px;border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-span__name{grid-area:name;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;min-block-size:44px}
.env2-coll-span__name a{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;min-block-size:44px;font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,19px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.24;color:var(--env2-ink);unicode-bidi:isolate;transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-span__name a:hover,.env2-coll-span__name a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-span__axis{grid-area:axis;margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.35;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-coll-span__axis bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__sep{color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-coll-span__bar{grid-area:bar;position:relative;block-size:26px;inline-size:100%}
.env2-coll-span__track{position:absolute;inset-block-start:50%;inset-inline:0;block-size:1px;background:var(--env2-hair);transform:translateY(-50%)}
.env2-coll-span__solid{position:absolute;inset-block-start:50%;inset-inline-start:0;block-size:5px;min-inline-size:4px;transform:translateY(-50%);background:linear-gradient(to left,var(--env2-glow),var(--env2-gold));box-shadow:0 0 18px -4px rgba(255,211,148,.6);inline-size:calc(var(--env2-span-a,0%) * var(--lit,1));transition:inline-size .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);transition-delay:var(--env2-span-d,0ms)}
.env2-coll-span__thin{position:absolute;inset-block-start:50%;inset-inline-start:var(--env2-span-a,0%);block-size:1px;transform:translateY(-50%);background:var(--env2-glow);opacity:.55;inline-size:calc(var(--env2-span-w,0%) * var(--lit,1));transition:inline-size .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);transition-delay:var(--env2-span-d,0ms)}
.env2-coll-span__cap{position:absolute;inset-block-start:50%;inset-inline-start:var(--env2-span-b,0%);margin-inline-start:-1px;block-size:13px;inline-size:1px;transform:translateY(-50%);background:var(--env2-glow);opacity:calc(.55 * var(--lit,1));transition:opacity .5s;transition-delay:var(--env2-span-d,0ms)}
.env2-coll-span__figs{grid-area:figs;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;text-align:end}
.env2-coll-span__from{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.2em}
.env2-coll-span__from .env2-price{--env2-price-size:22px}
.env2-coll-span__fromword{font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.env2-coll-span__to{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--env2-mute);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__per{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;color:var(--env2-ink-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.env2-coll-span__close{margin-block-start:clamp(40px,5vw,72px);margin-inline-start:auto;inline-size:min(100%,760px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,280px),1fr));gap:clamp(22px,3vw,44px)}
.env2-coll-span__tbl{inline-size:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
.env2-coll-span__cap2{caption-side:top;text-align:start;padding-block-end:10px;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--env2-gold)}
.env2-coll-span__cap2 bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__tbl th,.env2-coll-span__tbl td{text-align:start;vertical-align:baseline;padding-block:12px;padding-inline:0 12px;border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair);font-weight:400}
.env2-coll-span__tbl thead th{padding-block:0 8px;border-block-start:0;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-coll-span__tbl tbody th{font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--env2-ink);line-height:1.3}
.env2-coll-span__tbl tbody th a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-block-size:44px;color:var(--env2-ink);unicode-bidi:isolate;transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-span__tbl tbody th a:hover,.env2-coll-span__tbl tbody th a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-span__tbl td{white-space:nowrap}
.env2-coll-span__tbl .env2-price{--env2-price-size:17px}
.env2-coll-span__cell-per{font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-size:15px;font-weight:300;color:var(--env2-ink-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__notes{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;grid-column:1/-1}
.env2-coll-span__note{font-size:14px;font-weight:300;color:var(--env2-ink-2);padding-block:8px;border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-span__note a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-block-size:44px;color:var(--env2-ink);unicode-bidi:isolate}
.env2-coll-span__note a:hover,.env2-coll-span__note a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-span__note bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.env2-coll-span__foot{margin:clamp(30px,3.4vw,52px) 0 0;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-mute);max-width:62ch}
@media (max-width:899px){
  .env2-coll-span__head{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);align-items:start}
  .env2-coll-span__res{padding-inline-start:0;padding-block-start:14px;border-inline-start:0;border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
  .env2-coll-span__rung{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"name figs" "axis figs" "bar bar";min-block-size:72px;row-gap:4px;padding-block:10px 18px}
  .env2-coll-span__bar{block-size:14px;margin-block:8px 2px}
  .env2-coll-span__per{white-space:normal}
  .env2-coll-span__figs{align-self:start}
  .env2-coll-span__from .env2-price{--env2-price-size:20px}
  .env2-coll-span__close{inline-size:100%;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .env2-coll-span__tbl th,.env2-coll-span__tbl td{padding-inline:0 8px}
  .env2-coll-span__tbl tbody th{font-size:14px}
  .env2-coll-span__cell-per{font-size:14px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .env2-coll-span__solid,.env2-coll-span__thin,.env2-coll-span__cap,.env2-coll-span__name a,.env2-coll-span__tbl tbody th a{transition:none}
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
/* elmsnest-v2-coll-span — there is no behaviour to lose here.
   Every rung, bar, price and per-unit figure is markup, and the bars are drawn at full length with
   this file deleted (the core's --lit is 1 until html.env2-js dims it). All this does is hand the
   rungs to the shared lamp observer so they fill cheapest-first, and light them itself if the core
   bundle is missing — the CONTRACT's closing fallback line. */
(function () {
  function init(el) {
    if (el.__env2CollSpan) return;
    el.__env2CollSpan = true;
    window.env2 ? env2.observe(el) : el.querySelectorAll('[data-lamp]').forEach(function (l) { l.classList.add('lit'); });
  }
  function boot(root) {
    var scope = (root && root.querySelectorAll) ? root : document;
    scope.querySelectorAll('[data-env2-coll-span]').forEach(init);
    if (scope !== document && scope.matches && scope.matches('[data-env2-coll-span]')) init(scope);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () { boot(document); });
  } else {
    boot(document);
  }
  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) { boot(e.target || document); });
})();
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "פער המחירים",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "env2-coll-span-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enabled", "label": "להציג את המסך", "default": true,
      "info": "כבוי = הקטע לא מודפס כלל." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "show_on", "label": "באילו קולקציות",
      "options": [
        { "value": "auto", "label": "אוטומטי — רק כשיש ציר כמות" },
        { "value": "always", "label": "בכל קולקציה שיש בה פער" }
      ],
      "default": "auto",
      "info": "אוטומטי מדפיס את המסך רק בקולקציה שנמכרת בה מנורה לפי כמות — שבילים, ספוטים והקטלוג. בגרילנדות ובתאורת הקיר אין ציר כזה והמסך לא מודפס." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "הפתיח" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "שורת פתיחה", "default": "אותה קולקציה, פי {ratio_word}",
      "info": "{ratio_word} = היחס במילים, {ratio} = בספרות. שניהם מחושבים מהמחירים." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "כותרת", "default": "כמה מנורות צריך?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "deck", "label": "המשפט",
      "default": "המוצר היקר בקולקציה עולה פי {ratio} מהזול — לא כי הוא מנורה טובה יותר, אלא כי הוא סט של {units} יחידות.",
      "info": "{ratio} היחס · {units} מספר היחידות בווריאציה היקרה · {price} המחיר ליחידה." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "deck_alt", "label": "המשפט כשאין ציר כמות",
      "default": "המוצר היקר בקולקציה עולה פי {ratio} מהזול. הווריאציה היקרה שלו היא {value} — זה ההפרש.",
      "info": "{value} = הערך של הווריאציה היקרה ביותר." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "resolution_line", "label": "שורת הפתרון",
      "default": "{units_word} מנורות לאורך הדרך, {price} ₪ כל אחת.",
      "info": "{units_word} מספר היחידות במילים · {price} המחיר ליחידה. ריקה = לא מודפסת." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "הסולם" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "scale_label", "label": "תווית הסולם", "default": "סולם ליניארי" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "band_1_max", "label": "גבול הפס הראשון", "min": 0, "max": 1000, "step": 10, "unit": "₪", "default": 150 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "band_2_max", "label": "גבול הפס השני", "min": 0, "max": 1000, "step": 10, "unit": "₪", "default": 350 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "count_noun", "label": "שם המוצרים בספירה", "default": "מנורות" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "from_word", "label": "המילה שלפני מחיר הכניסה", "default": "מ־" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "to_word", "label": "המילה שלפני המחיר המרבי", "default": "עד" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "options_noun", "label": "שם האפשרויות בכיתוב הציר", "default": "אפשרויות" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "העמודה הסוגרת" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_unit_price", "label": "להציג מחיר ליחידה", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "unit_stops", "label": "הכמויות שמשווים", "default": "4,8",
      "info": "רשימה מופרדת בפסיקים. מוצר מופיע בעמודה רק אם הוא באמת נמכר בכמות הזאת." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "unit_noun", "label": "שם היחידה ברבים", "default": "נקודות" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "per_unit_word", "label": "המילה של המחיר ליחידה", "default": "₪ לנקודה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "at_word", "label": "המילה שלפני הכמות", "default": "ב־" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "or_word", "label": "המילה שבין כמויות", "default": "או" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sold_only", "label": "פתיחת הערת הכמויות", "default": "נמכרת" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "only_word", "label": "סיום הערת הכמויות", "default": "בלבד" },
